                    "message": "@Fred.Chen@quantatw.com Is that the correct understanding that 2 refers to module#3 and 3 refers to #2 as per GPIO names?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/recipes-phosphor/gpio/phosphor-gpio-monitor/plat-phosphor-multi-gpio-monitor.json",
