                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Fred Chen",
                        "email": "Fred.Chen@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "fredchenquanta"
                    },
                    "message": "That's correct. The MCIO numbering and physical slot IDs don't align. Per the EE schematic, MCIO #2 is routed to Module #3, and MCIO #3 is routed to Module #2. It's a bit confusing, but that's the current mapping."
                }
